1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,439
Speaking, task three. Story number 14: The Czech exam. What did Oksana do last month? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:12,133 --> 00:00:14,001
What did Oksana do last month?

3
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:37,532
Last month Oksana took a Czech exam.

4
00:00:37,733 --> 00:00:39,433
Every evening she studied Czech.

5
00:00:39,633 --> 00:00:42,933
She read texts, listened to recordings and wrote e-mails.

6
00:00:43,133 --> 00:00:45,625
On Saturday morning she went to the exam at a language school.

7
00:00:45,833 --> 00:00:47,388
She was a bit nervous.

8
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:51,461
First she did the written part: reading, writing and listening.

9
00:00:51,667 --> 00:00:54,129
The test was hard, but she managed it.

10
00:00:54,333 --> 00:00:57,367
A month later she got a certificate that she had passed.

11
00:00:57,567 --> 00:01:00,055
She was very happy and called her husband straight away.

12
00:01:00,267 --> 00:01:02,788
In the evening she celebrated with her family at a restaurant.

13
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:12,955
Tell story 14 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
